/T (12. Conclusion  This project successfully demonstrates that hybrid CPU-GPU parallelism can be applied effectively to  classical machine learning algorithms. By mapping the computationally dominant assignment step to the GPU and the reduction-oriented update step to OpenMP threads, the implementation achieves clean separation of concerns and excellent parallel efficiency. )
/E (12. Conclusion  This project successfully demonstrates that hybrid CPU-GPU parallelism can be applied effectively to  classical machine learning algorithms. By mapping the computationally dominant assignment step to the GPU and the reduction-oriented update step to OpenMP threads, the implementation achieves clean separation of concerns and excellent parallel efficiency. )
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
