/Title (1. Introduction  This report presents a hybrid parallel implementation of the K-Means clustering algorithm, combining GPU- based parallelism via CUDA with CPU-level multi-threading through OpenMP. The project demonstrates how heterogeneous computing architectures can dramatically accelerate data-intensive machine learning workloads.)
