/Title (12. Conclusion  This project successfully demonstrates that hybrid CPU-GPU parallelism can be applied effectively to  classical machine learning algorithms. By mapping the computationally dominant assignment step to the GPU and the reduction-oriented update step to OpenMP threads, the implementation achieves clean separation of concerns and excellent parallel efficiency.)
/Dest [22 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 938 0 R
/Next 739 0 R
