/Title (8.3 Race Condition Prevention  The OpenMP update function avoids race conditions through thread-local accumulation. Each thread maintains private localSum and localCount arrays during the parallel for loop. Only the brief merge step is protected by #pragma omp critical, minimizing lock contention and maximizing throughput.)
/Dest [18 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 1047 0 R
/Next 1037 0 R
>>
endobj
